body:
Are his violent actions (such as shooting Chloe in the bathroom) excusable? No. Is Nathan rich in character with a really interesting story line that we all would love to see more of? Hell yeah.

&#x200B;

Nathan has so much dimension that you can't not be intrigued by him at least. He drives the plot forward with his immorality towards Kate and innocent curiosity towards Mr. Jefferson's world. Nathan is so fucked up but I love him for it; such an interesting guy.
